.TH SIGEMPTYSET 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
sigemptyset \- clear a Crunch signal set
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <signal.h>
.B int sigemptyset(sigset_t* set);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Clears the eight\-byte Linux x86\-64 signal set. This is not libc's sigset_t.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero, or \-1 with errno set to EINVAL if set is NULL.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sigaction (3crunch)
